<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bid to Latin America.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bid to Latin America.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Wednesday it accepted a bid from CIV International Inc to sell 210 tonnes of nonfat dry milk to Caribbean, Central and South American countries.</p>
<p>Bonus was $917 per tonne and delivery was set for Oct 15-Dec 15.</p>
<p>DEIP balance for the region is 49,790 tonnes.</p>
